	(text "The ESP32 Arduino Nano is the brain of the car. In this version, only five Digital\npins are in use. The icon is handmade and prone to problems for an acual\nPCB design. This ican should only be seen as a visual guide. For an actual\nPCB desin, use headers. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.086 122.936 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "07520071-865c-4f4c-86da-328c0563a569")
	)
	(text "Servo for steering the car. Uses a PWM signal from the ESP32 to generate\na signal between 200-500 Hz\n\nNote: The servo uses 5 V from a voltage regulator and NOT from the 7.4 V\nBattery\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 227.584 59.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1ed603ef-b363-44c8-9b2b-89ba3d4a8c9d")
	)
	(text "This design uses a 7.4 V battery with 350mAh to power the car.\nWe use a switch to save on battery, we also have a connector\nbetween the battery and switch to be able to disconect the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.998 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "83f749ad-0e6f-4aa5-b025-8f87fbe9f2c1")
	)
	(text "MC6550 is a motor controller that uses a H-Bridge. This model can only power \none motor. The controller has multiple pins, but in this project only the listed\nones is in use. IN1 and IN2 determens direction (forward or backwards) and \nnSLEEP_HP (SLP on the actuall card) Is a PWM signal that determens speed. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.606 117.348 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9d3c3223-dd2c-46a9-b806-96ce6bc41ee3")
	)
	(text "Simple brush-DC-motor. Came with the car and uses a direction between\nbetween the poles to go forward or backwards\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 184.658 16.002 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c8d7f139-650c-4c5e-969f-67d1f11971ed")
	)
	(text "L7805 is a voltage regulator that forces a voltage from x to 5 V. \nThis conponent is crucial becuse of the volage limit (5 V) on the\nIR-sensor and the servo for function. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 78.232 65.786 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dc3d359a-a9c1-4f4f-b962-dfa018c1de50")
	)
	(text "Ir-sensor to determen distan. If the distans is closer then X cm, \nthe car loses power to the engines\n\nNote. The IR-sensor uses 5 V from a voltage regulator and NOT 7.4 V from the battery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 239.014 120.142 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "edd4664d-ac64-4ae8-9607-3cee83032add")
	)
